{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c","type":"group","x":-150,"y":400,"width":350,"height":500,"color":"1","label":"Traditional Workflows"},
		{"id":"5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a","type":"group","x":400,"y":400,"width":350,"height":500,"color":"4","label":"Agentic Workflows"},
		{"id":"0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b","type":"text","text":"# Agentic Workflows\n\n**The AI Automation Revolution**\n\nShift from explicit step-by-step instructions to outcome-based automation","x":300,"y":150,"width":400,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d","type":"text","text":"## Old Way\n\n- Drag & configure nodes\n- Manual variable setup\n- Explicit conditionals\n- Error → Debug → Fix cycle","x":-130,"y":440,"width":310,"height":120},
		{"id":"3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e","type":"text","text":"**Everything on you:**\n\n- Every API connection\n- Every variable\n- Every condition","x":-130,"y":600,"width":310,"height":100},
		{"id":"4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f","type":"text","text":"**Result:** \n\nTime-consuming, error-prone, needs technical skills","x":-130,"y":750,"width":310,"height":80},
		{"id":"6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b","type":"text","text":"## New Way\n\n- Describe outcome in plain English\n- Agent figures out the steps\n- Adaptive problem-solving\n- Natural conversation","x":420,"y":440,"width":310,"height":60},
		{"id":"9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e","type":"text","text":"## How It Works\n\n**Like hiring a human developer:** You explain the outcome & problem, the tools available, and what the end result looks like. The agent builds it for you.","x":50,"y":1050,"width":700,"height":170,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c","type":"text","text":"**You focus on:**\n\n- What data you have\n- What needs to happen\n- Where it should end up","x":420,"y":600,"width":310,"height":60},
		{"id":"8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d","type":"text","text":"**Result:** \n\nFast, flexible, accessible to non-coders","x":420,"y":750,"width":310,"height":150},
		{"id":"ae1f2a3b4c5d6e7f","type":"text","text":"## Key Requirements\n\n✓ Clear communication\n✓ Know your goal\n✓ Describe the problem","x":-150,"y":1300,"width":250,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bf2a3b4c5d6e7f8a","type":"text","text":"## Agent Benefits\n\n✓ Asks clarifying questions\n✓ Brainstorms solutions\n✓ Adapts to changes\n✓ Learns from feedback","x":150,"y":1300,"width":250,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ca3b4c5d6e7f8a9b","type":"text","text":"## Accessibility\n\n✓ No coding required\n✓ Plain English instructions\n✓ Non-technical users\n✓ Clear articulation needed","x":450,"y":1300,"width":250,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db4c5d6e7f8a9b0c","type":"text","text":"## The Power of Clear Scope\n\n**Communication is everything**\n\nIf you can't explain clearly what you want, an AI agent can't build it either.","x":300,"y":1600,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"6"}
	],
